1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:02,210
(Even after starting college,)

2
00:00:02,210 --> 00:00:03,800
(I still couldn't change...)

3
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:05,210
Huh?!

4
00:00:05,210 --> 00:00:06,760
This person...

5
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:08,680
You...

6
00:00:08,680 --> 00:00:10,180
will definitely become a great actor.

7
00:00:11,140 --> 00:00:13,640
(To have someone expect so much of me...)

8
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:15,770
(it's a first for me...)

9
00:00:15,770 --> 00:00:17,310
In Soshu Odawara,

10
00:00:17,310 --> 00:00:20,020
passing through Isshiki-machi,

11
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:21,440
and past Aomono-cho...

12
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:23,110
Are you interested in joining?

13
00:00:23,110 --> 00:00:25,110
Can I... Can I just

14
00:00:25,110 --> 00:00:25,940
take a look?

15
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:27,570
Of course! Come on in.

16
00:00:29,110 --> 00:00:30,320
Excuse me.

17
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:37,410
Since you're here,

18
00:00:37,410 --> 00:00:38,540
why don't you give it a try?

19
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:39,410
Huh? Oh...

20
00:00:39,410 --> 00:00:41,010
Here, read this part!

21
00:00:41,710 --> 00:00:42,880
Give it a try.

22
00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:44,140
Okay.

23
00:00:45,170 --> 00:00:47,170
Um, well...

24
00:00:49,090 --> 00:00:51,340
What is love? 'Tis not hereafter;

25
00:00:51,340 --> 00:00:52,840
Present mirth hath present laughter;

26
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:54,300
That's great!

27
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:55,720
Try to project

28
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:56,680
your voice a bit more.

29
00:00:56,680 --> 00:00:57,470
Okay.

30
00:00:57,470 --> 00:01:00,100
Mirth and laughter

31
00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:02,770
fade in an instant.

32
00:01:02,770 --> 00:01:04,810
The future...

33
00:01:04,810 --> 00:01:08,030
The future is unsure,
like a fickle flower.

34
00:01:08,030 --> 00:01:09,740
Give me a parting kiss,

35
00:01:10,450 --> 00:01:12,070
for a fleeting heart

36
00:01:12,070 --> 00:01:13,530
is like a flower.

37
00:01:13,530 --> 00:01:15,410
Oh!

38
00:01:17,290 --> 00:01:19,120
That was amazing!

39
00:01:19,330 --> 00:01:21,790
Thank you

40
00:01:21,790 --> 00:01:22,870
for letting me visit today.

41
00:01:22,870 --> 00:01:23,750
Sure.

42
00:01:23,750 --> 00:01:25,540
You're welcome back anytime.

43
00:01:25,540 --> 00:01:26,540
Thank you!

44
00:01:29,250 --> 00:01:30,960
- Laughter and love,

45
00:01:30,960 --> 00:01:33,090
- are ready to set off now.

46
00:01:33,300 --> 00:01:35,050
You know,

47
00:01:35,050 --> 00:01:37,430
you will definitely shine on stage.

48
00:01:37,810 --> 00:01:39,930
A place where I can shine...

49
00:01:43,810 --> 00:01:45,730
Please support me!

50
00:01:51,060 --> 00:01:52,230
(Club Application Form)

51
00:01:53,490 --> 00:01:54,660
Um...

52
00:01:55,160 --> 00:01:57,780
thank you for earlier.

53
00:02:08,590 --> 00:02:09,750
Everyone,

54
00:02:09,750 --> 00:02:12,220
this is our new member, uh...

55
00:02:12,220 --> 00:02:13,760
Yamamoto Minato.

56
00:02:13,760 --> 00:02:15,050
Minato!

57
00:02:18,100 --> 00:02:19,720
Nice to meet you!

58
00:02:19,720 --> 00:02:21,890
- Alright, let's start practicing!
- Okay!

59
00:02:21,890 --> 00:02:23,270
Senpai...

60
00:02:23,270 --> 00:02:25,190
Just call me Haru.

61
00:02:25,940 --> 00:02:27,980
Haru senpai,

62
00:02:27,980 --> 00:02:30,480
it's nice to meet you.

63
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:37,450
I'm going to make you the lead.

64
00:02:37,450 --> 00:02:40,410
But the lead of Twelfth Night,
Viola,

65
00:02:40,410 --> 00:02:41,870
isn't she a girl?

66
00:02:41,870 --> 00:02:43,960
You'll be cross-dressing

67
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:45,410
to play Viola.

68
00:02:46,210 --> 00:02:47,130
That's impossible.

69
00:02:47,130 --> 00:02:49,590
No way. How do you know
if you haven't even tried?

70
00:02:50,590 --> 00:02:54,010
This is our little secret.

71
00:02:55,760 --> 00:02:57,060
I really can't do it...
